ts","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ewUSU4zZDUYaavehQFeZVw","review_id":"XYhL6vW3l-qH0LhGxNn-3Q","date":"2015-04-27T15:24:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9104117751121521,"text_excerpt":"I can't believe more people weren't stumbling in here... \"Completely effed up in 20 oz or less\" should be this place's slogan. Not only were drinks very potent - they were amazingly good. I had a daquiri somewhere down the street and it was all harsh alcohol taste and strange Koolaid flavor on the back end that was just foul. Whereas Daiquiri Delight's offerings just kept creeping up on me and whacking me in the head with a faceful of Drunk! Staff was nice and I was in and out so quick that it was perfect for getting back out onto the street and enjoy the chaos of Mardis Gras! Just be sure to have cash in hand as they don't take credit cards."},{"business_id":"ewUSU4zZDUYaavehQFeZVw","review_id":"eT8lvgC6Gf8RsztI0fJ-Lw","date":"2016-09-07T19:51:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9055884480476379,"text_excerpt":"Love the daquiri's from here! Literally the only thing I drink while in Nola! I definitely recommend the drinks here. The pizza is very good as well!"},{"business_id":"ewUSU4zZDUYaavehQFeZVw","review_id":"jiK0EPnaDN1EqlN9yWilKg","date":"2018-08-27T17:27:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9038549661636353,"text_excerpt":"With so many frozen daiquiri bars to chose from on Bourbon Street, my friends and I determined the Daiquiri Delight served the best! With flavors like White Russian, Peach Colada, Hurricanes, and a variety of others, these seemed to taste the best and were strong. This small shop was one of the cleaner ones and the guys behind the bar were friendly and quick. I definitely recommend Daiquiri Delight above the rest!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ewUSU4zZDUYaavehQFeZVw","photo_id":"eyOZ-q_GkYJWxGBQYXLaSw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/eyOZ-q_GkYJWxGBQYXLaSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
